---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | Xuan(Kristy) Huang - VFX Artist">
	<main class="pt-24 pb-16">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-6">
			<div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-12 md:flex-row">
				<!-- Profile Image -->
				<div class="w-full md:w-1/3">
					<div class="group relative aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
						<div
							class="absolute inset-0 bg-gray-200/20 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:bg-transparent"
						>
						</div>
						<!-- Placeholder for profile image -->
						<div class="flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center bg-gray-100">
							<svg
								xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
								class="h-24 w-24 text-gray-400"
								fill="none"
								viewBox="0 0 24 24"
								stroke="currentColor"
							>
								<path
									stroke-linecap="round"
									stroke-linejoin="round"
									stroke-width="1"
									d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"
								></path>
							</svg>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="mt-8 rounded-xl bg-gray-100 p-6">
						<h3 class="mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Skills</h3>
						<div class="space-y-4">
							<div>
								<div class="mb-1 flex justify-between">
									<span class="text-gray-700">3D Animation</span>
									<span class="text-gray-500">95%</span>
								</div>
								<div class="h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-gray-200">
									<div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-800" style="width: 95%">
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div>
								<div class="mb-1 flex justify-between">
									<span class="text-gray-700">Visual Effects</span>
									<span class="text-gray-500">90%</span>
								</div>
								<div class="h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-gray-200">
									<div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-800" style="width: 90%">
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div>
								<div class="mb-1 flex justify-between">
									<span class="text-gray-700">Compositing</span>
									<span class="text-gray-500">85%</span>
								</div>
								<div class="h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-gray-200">
									<div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-800" style="width: 85%">
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div>
								<div class="mb-1 flex justify-between">
									<span class="text-gray-700">Motion Graphics</span>
									<span class="text-gray-500">80%</span>
								</div>
								<div class="h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-gray-200">
									<div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-800" style="width: 80%">
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div>
								<div class="mb-1 flex justify-between">
									<span class="text-gray-700">Rigging</span>
									<span class="text-gray-500">75%</span>
								</div>
								<div class="h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-gray-200">
									<div class="h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-800" style="width: 75%">
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- About Content -->
				<div class="lg:col-span-3">
					<div class="prose max-w-none">
						<h2>My Story</h2>
						<p>
							Hi, I'm Xuan(Kristy) Huang, a passionate VFX artist with expertise in creating
							stunning visual effects and animations. With over [X] years of
							experience in the industry, I've had the privilege of working on a
							variety of exciting projects across film, television, and digital media.
						</p>

						<p>
							My journey began with a fascination for blending art and technology to
							create immersive visual experiences. I graduated from [Your
							University/School] with a degree in [Your Degree], which provided me
							with a strong foundation in both technical skills and creative
							storytelling.
						</p>

						<h2 class="mt-8">Experience</h2>
						<p>
							Throughout my career, I've collaborated with talented teams on projects
							ranging from blockbuster films to innovative digital campaigns. My
							expertise includes [list your specific expertise areas like particle
							simulations, fluid dynamics, character animation, etc.].
						</p>

						<p>
							I've worked with leading studios such as [Studio Name] and [Studio
							Name], contributing to projects like [Project Name] and [Project Name].
							These experiences have honed my ability to deliver high-quality visual
							effects that enhance storytelling and create memorable viewer
							experiences.
						</p>

						<h2 class="mt-8">My Approach</h2>
						<p>
							I believe that great visual effects should seamlessly integrate with the
							narrative, enhancing the story without overpowering it. My approach
							combines technical precision with artistic vision, always striving to
							push the boundaries of what's possible while maintaining a focus on the
							emotional impact of the work.
						</p>

						<p>
							When I'm not creating visual effects, I enjoy [mention hobbies or
							interests that might be relevant], which continuously inspire my
							creative process and bring fresh perspectives to my work.
						</p>

						<div class="mt-8">
							<h2>Software & Tools</h2>
							<div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
								<span
									class="rounded-full bg-gray-200 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-gray-700"
									>Maya</span
								>
								<span
									class="rounded-full bg-gray-200 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-gray-700"
									>Houdini</span
								>
								<span
									class="rounded-full bg-gray-200 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-gray-700"
									>Nuke</span
								>
								<span
									class="rounded-full bg-gray-200 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-gray-700"
									>After Effects</span
								>
								<span
									class="rounded-full bg-gray-200 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-gray-700"
									>Cinema 4D</span
								>
								<span
									class="rounded-full bg-gray-200 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-gray-700"
									>ZBrush</span
								>
								<span
									class="rounded-full bg-gray-200 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-gray-700"
									>Substance Designer</span
								>
								<span
									class="rounded-full bg-gray-200 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-gray-700"
									>Unreal Engine</span
								>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="mt-12">
						<a
							href="/contact"
							class="inline-block rounded-lg bg-gray-900 px-6 py-3 font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-gray-800"
						>
							Get In Touch
						</a>
						<a
							href="/showcase"
							class="ml-4 inline-block rounded-lg border border-gray-900 bg-transparent px-6 py-3 font-medium text-gray-900 transition hover:bg-gray-100"
						>
							View My Work
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
